                    Confidential. A copy was sent to Komer.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d464-f2" n="2" xml:id="d464-f2-content">
                <p>For text of Assistant Secretary Williams’ speech, see <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >American Foreign Policy: Current Documents, 1965</hi>, pp. 677–679.</p>
            </note>
